{
  "slug": "competition-checker",
  "name": "Competition Checker",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Reviews startup competition T&Cs and produces a neutral, evidence-first scorecard across 7 founder-calibrated dimensions: IP & ownership, equity & financial, exclusivity & restraint, publicity & data, commitment cost, jurisdiction & disputes, and prize mechanics. Every flag quotes the clause verbatim with a source reference. Flags what T&Cs say AND what they don't say (omission detection). Investment-term deep dive for SAFE/convertible-note prizes. Cross-competition side-by-side comparison. Optional founder profile enables Fit Analysis and ROI Factors. Input-agnostic — accepts URLs, PDFs, screenshots, or pasted text. Falls back to browser automation when sites block AI fetchers. Neutral by design: never says \"apply\" or \"don't apply\" — surfaces the clauses, you decide.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **9 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `competition-checker` (Use this skill when the user asks to review or evaluate a startup competition's terms and conditions, asks…)\n- **Commands** (9): `check` (Review a startup competition's T&Cs), `compare` (Compare 2–5 competitions side by side), `diff` (Compare the two most recent checks of a given competition), `list` (List all stored competition checks and their dates), `prune` (Remove older stored reports for a competition, keeping the N most recent), `sentiment` (Scan online community sentiment about a recurring startup competition), `unwatch` (Stop a T&C watch before its deadline), `watch` (Watch a competition's T&Cs for changes until its deadline), and 1 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install competition-checker@claude-community` from `chiKeka/competition-checker`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "command": 9
  },
